{"status": 200, "url_final": "https://openhermit.ai/", "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"> <head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Open-source TypeScript platform for deploying AI agents with durable state, sandboxed execution, built-in channels, schedules, skills, and MCP servers.\"><meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#ffffff\"><link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/svg+xml\" href=\"/logo.svg\"><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"OpenHermit \u2014 Deploy AI Agents as Production Services\"><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Open-source TypeScript platform for deploying AI agents with durable state, sandboxed execution, built-in channels, schedules, skills, and MCP servers.\"><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://openhermit.ai\"><title>OpenHermit \u2014 Deploy AI Agents as Production Services</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_astro/Footer.BSm2qfqt.css\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_astro/HomePage.BooEFmY3.css\"></head> <body>  <nav class=\"nav\" data-astro-cid-dmqpwcec> <div class=\"nav__left\" data-astro-cid-dmqpwcec> <a href=\"/\" class=\"logo\" data-astro-cid-dmqpwcec> <img src=\"/logo.svg\" alt=\"OpenHermit\" class=\"logo__img\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" data-astro-cid-dmqpwcec> <span class=\"logo__text\" data-astro-cid-dmqpwcec>openhermit</span> </a> <div class=\"nav__links\" data-astro-cid-dmqpwcec> <a href=\"/blog\" class data-astro-cid-dmqpwcec>Blog</a> <a href=\"/manual\" class data-astro-cid-dmqpwcec>Manual</a> <a href=\"/#features\" data-astro-cid-dmqpwcec>Features</a> <a href=\"/#quickstart\" data-astro-cid-dmqpwcec>Get Started</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/HCF-STUDIOS/openhermit/tree/main/docs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-astro-cid-dmqpwcec>Dev Docs</a> </div> </div> <div class=\"nav__right\" data-astro-cid-dmqpwcec> <div class=\"nav__lang\" data-astro-cid-dmqpwc